flowchart TD
    C[Call a named tool] --> E{Tool reports error?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Controlled failure]
    E -->|No| S{Declared output schema?}
    S -->|Yes| V{Structured result validates?}
    S -->|No| A[Application validation]
    V -->|Pass| A
    V -->|Fail| F
    A --> I{Requested identity matches?}
    I -->|Yes| U[Use the result]
    I -->|No| F
